    "answer": {
      "short": "Straight line: A, C, F.\n\nParabola: B, D, E, G, H.",
      "worked": "A, C and F have the form $y=mx+c$, so their graphs are straight lines.\n\nB, D, E and G have a non-zero $x^2$ term, so their graphs are parabolas. H is also quadratic:\n$$\\begin{aligned}y&=(6-2x)^2\\\\y&=4x^2-24x+36.\\end{aligned}$$\nStraight line: A, C, F.\n\nParabola: B, D, E, G, H.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
